{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "night-eater.meet",
  "kind": "character",
  "title": "電球が怯える夜",
  "summary": "照明管理室で、光をワイン のように味わう影と出会う",
  "ownership": {
    "arcId": "character.night-eater",
    "characterId": "night-eater",
    "stage": "meet"
  },
  "trigger": {
    "actions": [
      "work",
      "rest"
    ],
    "when": {
      "all": [],
      "any": [],
      "none": []
    },
    "repeat": {
      "mode": "once-per-run"
    },
    "priority": 500,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "照明管理室",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "night-eater.meet.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-lighting-control-room-v1.png",
        "alt": "照明管理室の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "night-eater.meet.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/encounters/night-eater.png",
        "alt": "スプーンで照明を味わう夜を食べるものの一枚絵"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "night-eater.meet.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "閉店五分前。修理伝票を片手に、照明管理室へ走った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "内容は「電球が一斉に怯えている」——変な苦情だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "扉を開けると、中は真っ暗だった。耳が、ぴんと立つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ここは照明の、いわば本丸のはずなのに。暗闇の奥、上品な影が、スプーンを持って座っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "night-eater.meet.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……この蛍光灯は、渋みが強い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "事務仕事の苦労の味がする。——三つ星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "食レポしてる場合ですか!　うちの電球が怯えてるんですけど!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "怯えさせてはいない。順番を、待たせているだけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……熟成中の光を先に食べるのは、無作法なので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "光を、食べる?　……犯人、見つけた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最近フロアが二割暗い理由は、この人だった。犯人は自首どころか、ソムリエ顔で格付け中。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "名乗ろうとした、その時だった。影の手元が滑って、スプーンが制御盤に触れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——フロア全体の音が、消えた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "flash"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "真っ暗。完全な、真っ暗だった。カジノの喧騒が、遠くのざわめきに変わる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳元で、声だけが、静かに近かった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……こわい?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "び、びっくりしただけです。それより早く戻してください、お客様が転びます!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "短い沈黙のあと、信じられないことが起きた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "影が、口元に手を当てて、光を一口ぶん、そっと戻した。シャンデリアが、灯り直る。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……戻したのは、初めて。味見済みの光は、少し優しい味になっているけれど。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "灯り直ったシャンデリアは、前より少し暖色だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "お客様たちが「今夜は明かりがきれいだ」と言っている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.013c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.013c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "営業妨害と営業貢献を同時にする人を、初めて見た。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私の夜は、長すぎるの。誰の朝にも、もう邪魔されない、終わった夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.014b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.014b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.ij983g",
      "speakerName": "夜を食べるもの",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……だから味のある光が、恋しくて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終わった夜。その言い方が、少し寂しい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.015b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.015b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "接客の頭で、考えた。怯える電球と、空腹の夜と、閉店五分前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.015c",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.015c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ぜんぶ解決する方法を。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "お客様。当店、賞味期限切れ間近の電球在庫が、倉庫に二百個ほどございます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.016b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.016b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "——お味見、なさいますか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.017a",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.017a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "影が、ぴたりと止まった。暗闇の中で、初めて表情が分かった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.line.017b",
      "lineId": "night-eater.meet.line.017b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "あれは絶対、目を輝かせている顔。光ってないのに、分かる。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "night-eater.meet.choice.001",
          "label": "照明を一列だけ消して話す",
          "result": "閉店後、在庫の電球二百個で試食会を開いた。彼女は「若い」「当たり年」と格付けし、怯える電球には「食べない」と宣言。翌朝、苦情はゼロ。机には星五つの評価票が置いてあった。",
          "intent": "追い出すより先に、腹を満たす段取りをする",
          "promise": "目先の報酬は得ない代わりに、この人が何に飢えているかを知る。",
          "memory": "在庫処分と夜食を両立させた店員として、夜を食べるものは私を覚えている。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "night-eater"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 7,
              "ownership": -2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "night-eater.meet.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "night-eater.meet.choice.002",
          "label": "今日は夜を食べるものを誘わず、用事へ戻る",
          "result": "伝票の原因欄に「美食家。対処、在庫案内済み」と正直に書いた。上長は首をかしげたが、苦情は来なくなった。倉庫の期限切れ電球だけが、毎週きれいに減っている。伝票の隅に、小さな星の落書きが増えていく。",
          "intent": "今日は修理伝票の処理に徹する",
          "promise": "所属選手にはならないが、後の出来事で再会できる。",
          "memory": "倉庫の在庫案内をした店員のことを、夜を食べるものは覚えている。",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [],
          "goto": "night-eater.meet.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "night-eater.meet.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "markEncountered",
          "fighterId": "night-eater",
          "encountered": true
        },
        {
          "type": "setStoryStage",
          "fighterId": "night-eater",
          "stage": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
